	;  #CMT#002#@CONTEXT@This is an error message.
	;  #CMT#002#{0}-This holds the surgery date.@
	;#STR#003#The status of the log has changed, possibly due to the actions of another user.  Changes may not be visible until the log is reopened.
	;  #CMT#003#@CONTEXT@This is an error message.@
	;#STR#004#The log has already been posted.
	;  #CMT#004#@CONTEXT@This is an error message.@
	;#STR#005#The log has already been voided.
	;  #CMT#005#@CONTEXT@This is an error message.@
	;#STR#006#Panel {{0}} is missing a primary performing surgeon.
	;  #CMT#006#@CONTEXT@Error message to inform the user that a required primary performing surgeon/provider is not documented on a given panel of a surgical log.
	;  #CMT#006#{{0}} - Panel number@
	;#STR#007#The log is not complete.
	;  #CMT#007#@CONTEXT@This is an error message.@
	;#STR#008#Panel {{0}} has multiple primary performing surgeons.
	;  #CMT#008#@CONTEXT@Error message to tell a user that a panel on a surgical log has more than one surgeon/provider indicated as a primary performer.
	;  #CMT#008#{{0}} - Panel number@
	;#STR#010#Log Posted
	;  #CMT#010#@CONTEXT@This is a part of audit trail.
	;  #CMT#010#Audit trails help in maintaining a record of the actions carried out by a user.
	;  #CMT#010#Such as editing patient information, surgery logs, etc.@
	q  ;;#eor#